n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n__NOTOC__\n==Ingredients==\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Nuts and seeds|nuts]] (e.g., [[Cookbook:Pecan|pecans]]), ground\n* 1 cup seeded [[cookbook:date|date]]s, ground\n* ½ cup white granulated [[cookbook:sugar|sugar]]\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Egg White|egg white]]s\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[cookbook:salt|salt]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]] [[cookbook:cream|cream]]\n* 1 cup [[cookbook:flour|flour]]\n* 1 teaspoon [[Cookbook:Baking Powder|baking powder]]\n* 1½ cup [[Cookbook:Powdered Sugar|confectioner's sugar]]\n* ¼ cup [[Cookbook:Lemon Juice|lemon juice]]\n* 1 teaspoon [[Cookbook:Vanilla|vanilla extract]]\n\n== Procedure == \n===Bars===\n# Grind the nuts and dates; [[cookbook:sift|sift]] in the granular sugar.\n# In another bowl, [[Cookbook:Whipping|whip]] egg whites until stiff.\n# Gradually add the sugar mixture, whipping constantly. [[Cookbook:Folding|Fold]] in the cream.\n# [[Cookbook:Sifting|Sift]] the flour, then re-sift the flour with the baking powder. Fold into the egg mixture.\n# Grease and flour a [[Cookbook:Baking Sheet|baking sheet]].\n# Pat dough ½-inch thick on the [[Cookbook:Cookie Sheet|baking sheet]], and [[Cookbook:Baking|bake]] for 10 minutes at 350°F (175°C).\n\n===Glaze===\n\n# [[cookbook:Mixing|Mix]] confectioner's sugar with lemon juice and vanilla in a [[cookbook:blender|blender]].\n# When the cookies are still hot, spread the glaze over them.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for cookies|Date nut bar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using date]]\n[[Category:Recipes using nuts and seeds]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes with images]]\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Recipes for bars]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using white sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using powdered sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cream]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg white]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]